    "integration_seams": [
      "GatewayRunner subclass installed before native bootstrap; start/stop and per-session persona prompt resolution",
      "stage_local_session skills_prompt freezes the composed persona; ignore_rules disables profile-wide soul/memory/context files",
      "Read pinned session_admissions status inside the domain lifecycle transaction to retain completed history and fence unfinished admissions",
      "GatewayRunner._run_agent checks live capability generation before model execution and reattaches exact native session MCP secrets on restart",
      "model_tools._execute_tool wrapper checks live grants at final dispatch; native editor_mcp scope isolates connector schemas/connections",
      "Gateway-owned goal continuation outbox with generation fences, native parked Kanban card mapping and native session admission; no shared session /goal or Kanban dispatcher activation",
      "Gateway-owned durable goal wake definitions and occurrence windows use native HeartbeatState due checks, heartbeat poll/minimum constants and cron compute_next_run interval arithmetic; shared continuation outbox/native admission only, without overlapping native cron jobs or session heartbeat registrations",
      "Owner-scoped provider journal uses native auth-store locks/atomic storage, native PKCE and narrowly adapted OpenRouter exchange; frozen nma_provider selection resolves through a credential-only loopback relay into native chat/Responses/Anthropic transports, without an alternate executor or provider fallback",
      "integration.py owns exact-pin signature checks and installation order for grant, registry, usage, context-reference and reliability adaptations; native middleware remains fail-open and cannot replace authorization",
      "Native typed history remains canonical; config-bound session lineage is seeded once through the pinned native transcript transaction helper, while context generations exclude revoked material",
      "Native compression/reset mutations use durable operation IDs plus revision/generation fencing; scoped auxiliary credential routes exist only while their authenticated command is pending",
      "Durable tool intent/execution/observation evidence distinguishes unknown writes from rejected dispatch and safe observation; native receipt queries reconcile effects without replay",
      "Task-local native config snapshot binds frozen compression/context settings in in-process turns; native tracked mutations cover accepted command and product receipt projection through shutdown",
      "Synchronous browser_exec syntax is compiled with the pinned Python 3.14 grammar before executor dispatch, without executing code; runtime exceptions and partially executed batches remain unknown",
      "Native registry-backed capability bundles retain original schemas and explicit dependency/execution-surface fingerprints; final model and registry dispatch share live authorization, including deferred and programmatic calls",
      "Pinned native PluginContext hooks, middleware and events are wrapped at registration with live agent grants; excluded external platform registrations fail closed; offline pinned install/update requires stopped and drained native admissions",
      "Versioned owner-local inference configuration freezes connection references and native fallback, auxiliary, ranking and MoA settings at admission; request parameters cross the credential-only relay unchanged",
      "Native CredentialPool selects scoped per-run relay references sharing one endpoint; only cooldown metadata persists, while the NMA-040 vault remains the sole provider credential and refresh writer",
      "Native auxiliary recovery gains a scoped HTTP 5xx classification predicate; native recovery selection and retry remain authoritative",
      "Native Linux handler placement adopts the NMA-028 tool supervisor, with image/schema checks, signed scope-bound RPC, a public-only verifier in the capsule, replay rejection and preserved unknown-effect receipts; native interrupt retires the capsule"
    ],
